le":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"the honours are even","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that the people or teams in a competition , game etc have done as well as each other or have the same score","translation":"می گفت که افراد یا تیم ها در یک مسابقه، بازی و غیره به خوبی یکدیگر عمل کرده اند یا امتیاز یکسانی دارند.","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
