('aaecb61d-ebb6-574a-b932-a728b6e61f06','3b2b7e2e-d275-543e-a973-3dc01a55b474',1,'noun','A2','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"as a matter of fact","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used when adding more details about what you have just said","translation":"هنگام افزودن جزئیات بیشتر در مورد آنچه که گفتید استفاده می شود","example":"‘Have you had many visitors yet?’ ‘No, as a matter of fact you’re the first.’","example_translation":"«تاکنون بازدیدکنندگان زیادی داشته‌اید؟» «نه، در واقع شما اولین نفر هستید.»","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825339.mp3"},{"phrase":"for that matter","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that what you are saying about one thing is also true about something else","translation":"می گفت آنچه شما در مورد یک چیز می گویید در مورد چیز دیگری نیز صادق است","example":"Ben never touched beer, or any kind of alcohol for that matter.","example_translation":"بن هرگز به آبجو یا هر نوع الکلی دست نزد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000213063.mp3"},{"phrase":"take matters into your own hands","register":null,"definition_en":"to deal with a problem yourself because other people have failed to deal with it","translation":"خودتان با یک مشکل کنار بیایید زیرا دیگران در مقابله با آن شکست خورده اند","example":"Local people took matters into their own hands and hired their own security guards.","example_translation":"مردم محلی امور را به دست گرفتند و محافظان امنیتی خود را استخدام کردند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000212915.mp3"},{"phrase":"be a matter of opinion","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that people have different opinions about something, especially when you yourself have a negative opinion","translation":"معمولاً می‌گفتند مردم در مورد چیزی نظرات متفاوتی دارند، مخصوصاً زمانی که خود شما نظر منفی دارید","example":"Whether or not he is any good as a manager is a matter of opinion.","example_translation":"اینکه آیا او به عنوان یک مدیر خوب است یا نه، یک موضوع است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001975006.mp3"},{"phrase":"be a matter of principle","register":null,"definition_en":"to be something that you feel you must or must not do, because of your moral principles","translation":"کاری باشید که به دلیل اصول اخلاقی خود احساس می کنید باید انجام دهید یا نباید انجام دهید","example":"She couldn’t take the money. It was a matter of principle.","example_translation":"او نتوانست پول را بردارد. یک موضوع اصولی بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001975014.mp3"},{"phrase":"be a matter of doing something","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that an action involves doing something","translation":"می گفت که یک عمل شامل انجام کاری است","example":"Reducing the number of road deaths is not simply a matter of improving roads.","example_translation":"کاهش تعداد تلفات جاده ای صرفاً به بهبود جاده ها مربوط نمی شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825330.mp3"},{"phrase":"as a matter of something","register":null,"definition_en":"because of a particular belief or quality","translation":"به دلیل یک باور یا کیفیت خاص","example":"He invited her as a matter of courtesy.","example_translation":"او را برای ادب دعوت کرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825337.mp3"},{"phrase":"as a matter of interest","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used when you ask or tell someone something that interests you but is not important","translation":"زمانی استفاده می‌شود که از کسی چیزی می‌پرسید که برایتان جالب است اما مهم نیست","example":"Just as a matter of interest, which school did you go to?","example_translation":"فقط به عنوان یک موضوع علاقه، کدام مدرسه رفتید؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000212980.mp3"},{"phrase":"as a matter of urgency","register":null,"definition_en":"if something is done or should be done as a matter of urgency , it is done or should be done very soon","translation":"اگر کاری به صورت فوری انجام شود یا باید انجام شود، خیلی زود انجام می شود یا باید انجام شود","example":"That procedure should be streamlined as a matter of urgency.","example_translation":"این رویه باید به صورت فوری ساده شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825346.mp3"},{"phrase":"no matter what","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that you will definitely do something","translation":"می گفت حتماً کاری خواهی کرد","example":"I’ll call you tonight, no matter what.","example_translation":"من امشب با شما تماس می گیرم، مهم نیست.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000212955.mp3"},{"phrase":"no matter","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that something is not important and will not affect a situation","translation":"معمولاً می‌گفتند چیزی مهم نیست و بر موقعیتی تأثیر نمی‌گذارد","example":"‘I’m afraid I forgot to bring a towel.’ ‘No matter, I’ve got one you can borrow.’","example_translation":"\"می ترسم یادم رفته حوله بیاورم.\"","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000212961.mp3"},{"phrase":"no matter that","register":null,"definition_en":"used to say that something is not important and will not affect a situation","translation":"قبلاً می گفت که چیزی مهم نیست و بر موقعیتی تأثیر نمی گذارد","example":"I would always be an outsider here – no matter that I spoke fluent Spanish.","example_translation":"من همیشه در اینجا یک خارجی خواهم بود - مهم نیست که اسپانیایی روان صحبت می کردم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825400.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
('729d0c27-7fb5-5e87-9439-a8e487d5c9f7','3b2b7e2e-d275-543e-a973-3dc01a55b474',2,'verb','A2','S1','W3',null,'[{"phrase":"what does it matter?","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that something is not important","translation":"می گفت چیزی مهم نیست","example":"It all happened so long ago now, what does it matter?","example_translation":"همه چیز خیلی وقت پیش اتفاق افتاده است، چه اهمیتی دارد؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825442.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
