a product that could harm you ) the health warning on cigarette packets','be in good/poor health (= be healthy/unhealthy ) Her parents were elderly and in poor health.','be good/bad for your health Eating plenty of vegetables is good for your health.','somebody''s state of health Your choice of exercise must depend on your general state of health.','health and well-being The breakfast program improves the health and well-being of the children.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The monthly trade figures are seen as an indicator of the health of the economy.","translation":"ارقام تجارت ماهانه به عنوان شاخصی از سلامت اقتصاد در نظر گرفته می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001350706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
