('79e6c3b5-658b-5d51-b1bc-e7e7e46cf9f5','68c9584b-b9c2-5fff-99a6-7b3d147a8764',1,'something that makes you proud','چیزی که باعث افتخار شماست','spoken & written','something that makes you feel very proud','[ singular ]',null,'افتخار، آبرو؛ اظهار احترام؛ مدال افتخار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a great honour It was a great honour to meet my hero in person.','a rare honour (= a very special honour that is not given to many people ) Being asked to paint a portrait for the queen is a rare honour for any artist.','a dubious honour (= something that you are not sure that you should be proud of ) The city has the dubious honor of being the smoggiest city in the world.','a signal honour formal (= a great honour ) He received the signal honour of becoming an Honorary Fellow of the college.','have the honour formal As a young man, he had the honour of meeting Winston Churchill.','do somebody the honour formal (= used when saying that you feel proud that someone has decided to do something ) Will you do me the honour of becoming my wife?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Over 100 players competed for the honour of representing the county in the National Finals.","translation":"بیش از 100 بازیکن برای افتخار نمایندگی شهرستان در فینال های ملی با هم رقابت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967081.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is an honor to have you here, sir.","translation":"حضور شما در اینجا باعث افتخار است قربان.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040089.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2c455b5b-1e14-5d39-9e5d-70784457b5d6','68c9584b-b9c2-5fff-99a6-7b3d147a8764',2,'respect','احترام گذاشتن','spoken & written','the respect that you, your family, your country etc receive from other people, which makes you feel proud','[ uncountable ]',null,'احترامی که شما، خانواده‌تان، کشورتان و غیره از دیگران دریافت می‌کنید، که باعث می‌شود احساس غرور کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was prepared even to die in order to defend the honour of his family.","translation":"او حتی برای دفاع از ناموس خانواده اش آماده مرگ بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001745308.mp3"},{"sentence":"For the French team, winning tomorrow’s game is a matter of national honour.","translation":"برای تیم فرانسه، پیروزی در بازی فردا یک موضوع افتخار ملی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001358494.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
