('7d783230-7946-5d73-b726-46036656f831','f8cbbce6-c0aa-5d2a-a16e-eaa4d9294120',2,null,null,'spoken & written','intended for babies or very young children',null,null,'برای نوزادان یا کودکان بسیار خردسال در نظر گرفته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"infant formula milk","translation":"شیر خشک نوزاد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001728003.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('35ef769d-f951-5470-8a98-702c5fc5ed9d','f8cbbce6-c0aa-5d2a-a16e-eaa4d9294120',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an infant company, organization etc has just started to exist or be developed',null,null,'یک شرکت نوزاد، سازمان و غیره به تازگی شروع به وجود یا توسعه کرده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"infant industries","translation":"صنایع نوزادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001450328.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('90041d7e-ed9c-5331-bdb5-4534390eb7eb','f43b2c36-2607-5eec-aac9-3d2c32db01e1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially tell someone about something or give them information',null,null,'آگاه کردن، خبر دادن (رسماً)؛ آگهی دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They decided to inform the police","translation":"تصمیم گرفتند به پلیس اطلاع دهند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001411132.mp3"},{"sentence":"Please inform us of any change of address as soon as possible.","translation":"لطفا در اسرع وقت هرگونه تغییر آدرس را به ما اطلاع دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744932.mp3"},{"sentence":"We regret to inform you that your application has been rejected.","translation":"با کمال تاسف به اطلاع شما می‌رسانیم که درخواست شما رد شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744935.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ba9cf9bd-9849-5808-8c37-eb388694863d','f43b2c36-2607-5eec-aac9-3d2c32db01e1',2,null,null,'formal','to influence someone’s attitude or opinion',null,null,'تأثیر گذاشتن بر نگرش یا عقیده کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her experience as a refugee informs the content of her latest novel.","translation":"تجربه او به عنوان یک پناهنده از محتوای آخرین رمان او خبر می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001411146.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('339a86a7-d134-558d-b540-77ed850d18f2','8c5b6761-d44a-57f7-b944-5a0e0ce1975a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to hurt yourself or someone else, for example in an accident or an attack',null,null,'مجروح کردن، آسیب رساندن (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Angus injured his leg playing rugby.","translation":"آنگوس در بازی راگبی پای خود را مصدوم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413205.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two people have been critically injured in an accident.","translation":"در یک تصادف دو نفر به شدت مجروح شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413208.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2dca34a7-6d37-5903-a583-ba108263b5b2','8c5b6761-d44a-57f7-b944-5a0e0ce1975a',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'injure somebody’s pride/feelings etc','مجروح کردن، آسیب رساندن (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('659d9ad7-9221-5e41-87b6-f251b8d52d83','248b047f-87a1-518e-8c47-76a49366966b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a wound or damage to part of your body caused by an accident or attack','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'صدمه، جراحت؛ آسیب (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['serious The injury wasn’t serious.','terrible (= very bad ) Some of the victims suffered terrible injuries.','fatal (= that kills someone ) Fortunately, his injuries weren’t fatal.','minor A man was treated in hospital for minor injuries.','permanent The brain can be affected by permanent injury after a serious accident.','a nasty injury (= quite bad ) Fairground rides can cause some nasty injuries.','a head/leg/shoulder etc injury He suffered a shoulder injury while playing rugby.','a spinal injury (= an injury to the spine ) The injured boy is being treated for a spinal injury.','a facial injury (= an injury to the face ) I was offered treatment for my facial injuries.','a sports injury (= one you get while doing sport ) She has vast knowledge of treating sports injuries.','an industrial injury (= one that happens at work ) He was the victim of an industrial injury.','internal injuries (= injuries inside your body ) He was coughing blood, a sign that he had internal injuries.','multiple injuries (= large number of injuries at the same time ) She had multiple injuries and a fractured skull.','have an injury Tom was OK, and had just a few minor injuries.','suffer an injury He suffered a serious leg injury in a motorcycle accident.','get an injury informal (= suffer an injury ) He couldn’t take the chance of getting an injury.','sustain/receive an injury formal (= suffer an injury ) She sustained an injury to her hip.','treat an injury The injury was treated at the local hospital.','recover from an injury It took her six months to recover from the injury.','escape/avoid injury Two workmen narrowly escaped injury when a wall collapsed.','cause an injury The injury was caused by flying glass from the car windscreen.','inflict an injury on somebody formal (= make someone have an injury ) Jenkins was accused of inflicting a head injury on one of his former colleagues.','do yourself an injury British English informal (= accidentally hurt yourself ) Be careful with that knife or you’ll do yourself an injury.','an injury happens/occurs The injury occurred five minutes into the game.','be prone to injury (= often get injuries ) She was rather prone to injury and often missed matches as a result.','injury problems British English: He suffered injury problems throughout his career as a footballer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was taken to hospital with serious head injuries.","translation":"او با جراحات شدید سر به بیمارستان منتقل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001990570.mp3"},{"sentence":"The driver of the truck suffered injuries to his legs and arms.","translation":"راننده کامیون از ناحیه پا و دست آسیب دید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040100.mp3"},{"sentence":"Beckham has missed several games through injury (= because of injury ) .","translation":"بکهام چندین بازی را به دلیل مصدومیت (= به دلیل مصدومیت) از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001990584.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a lawyer who specializes in personal injury claims.","translation":"او وکیلی است که در دعاوی جراحات شخصی متخصص است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750883.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('1f549b18-0d99-5e25-9791-25126b4bfe7d','248b047f-87a1-518e-8c47-76a49366966b',2,null,null,'law','damage to someone’s reputation , career , or feelings','[ uncountable ]',null,'صدمه زدن به شهرت، شغل یا احساسات یک نفر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['serious The injury wasn’t serious.','terrible (= very bad ) Some of the victims suffered terrible injuries.','fatal (= that kills someone ) Fortunately, his injuries weren’t fatal.','minor A man was treated in hospital for minor injuries.','permanent The brain can be affected by permanent injury after a serious accident.','a nasty injury (= quite bad ) Fairground rides can cause some nasty injuries.','a head/leg/shoulder etc injury He suffered a shoulder injury while playing rugby.','a spinal injury (= an injury to the spine ) The injured boy is being treated for a spinal injury.','a facial injury (= an injury to the face ) I was offered treatment for my facial injuries.','a sports injury (= one you get while doing sport ) She has vast knowledge of treating sports injuries.','an industrial injury (= one that happens at work ) He was the victim of an industrial injury.','internal injuries (= injuries inside your body ) He was coughing blood, a sign that he had internal injuries.','multiple injuries (= large number of injuries at the same time ) She had multiple injuries and a fractured skull.','have an injury Tom was OK, and had just a few minor injuries.','suffer an injury He suffered a serious leg injury in a motorcycle accident.','get an injury informal (= suffer an injury ) He couldn’t take the chance of getting an injury.','sustain/receive an injury formal (= suffer an injury ) She sustained an injury to her hip.','treat an injury The injury was treated at the local hospital.','recover from an injury It took her six months to recover from the injury.','escape/avoid injury Two workmen narrowly escaped injury when a wall collapsed.','cause an injury The injury was caused by flying glass from the car windscreen.','inflict an injury on somebody formal (= make someone have an injury ) Jenkins was accused of inflicting a head injury on one of his former colleagues.','do yourself an injury British English informal (= accidentally hurt yourself ) Be careful with that knife or you’ll do yourself an injury.','an injury happens/occurs The injury occurred five minutes into the game.','be prone to injury (= often get injuries ) She was rather prone to injury and often missed matches as a result.','injury problems British English: He suffered injury problems throughout his career as a footballer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He says that the allegations caused serious injury to his reputation.","translation":"او می گوید که این اتهامات باعث آسیب جدی به شهرت او شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040101.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('43589c89-7993-5178-9b62-363442c34edd','6c6dc4fb-f507-56e2-a0e5-6ca6d7e649ce',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small creature such as a fly or ant , that has six legs , and sometimes wings',null,null,'حشره، حشرات (شش‌پا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['small The bird’s natural diet mainly consists of small insects.','tiny (= very small ) The air was filled with thousands of tiny insects.','a flying insect Toads mainly eat small dark flying insects.','a winged insect literary: Swallows swooped to snatch winged insects from the sky.','an insect flies Insects were flying around the food on the counter.','an insect crawls (= moves along the ground ) A tiny insect was crawling up his arm.','an insect buzzes (= makes a continuous sound ) Insects were buzzing around our heads as we walked through the forest.','an insect bite He was worried about a large red insect bite on his back.','an insect sting (= a hole in your skin made by an insect ) This cream is good for treating insect stings.','insect repellent (= a chemical to keep insects away ) If you go camping, you should take some insect repellent.','an insect species Large numbers of insect species are becoming extinct.','insect eggs The leaves were covered in insect eggs.','insect larvae (= young insects with soft bodies and no wings ) Fish love food such as worms and insect larvae.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an insect bite","translation":"نیش حشره","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001414674.mp3"},{"sentence":"flying insects","translation":"حشرات پرنده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001414675.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t forget to bring insect repellent (= a chemical to keep insects away ) .","translation":"فراموش نکنید که دافع حشرات (= ماده شیمیایی برای دور نگه داشتن حشرات) همراه داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020110.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b6a2ac85-1752-58ad-a417-36719c2f2446','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',1,'container','ظرف','spoken & written','in or into a container or other closed space so as to be completely covered or surrounded',null,null,'درون، داخل؛ در (فضای بسته)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The jewels were locked away inside the safe.","translation":"جواهرات داخل گاوصندوق قفل شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415016.mp3"},{"sentence":"I sent the money inside an envelope addressed to Ann.","translation":"من پول را داخل یک پاکت به آدرس آن فرستادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415015.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carl picked up the book and stuffed it inside his jacket.","translation":"کارل کتاب را برداشت و داخل کاپشنش فرو کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718821.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her car was locked and the keys were inside.","translation":"ماشینش قفل بود و کلیدها داخلش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841197.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3f734e4c-ec92-58b0-9609-5c33a8165698','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',2,'building/room','ساختمان/اتاق','spoken & written','in or into a building or room',null,null,'در یک ساختمان یا اتاق یا داخل آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s raining. We’ll have to go inside.","translation":"باران می بارد باید بریم داخل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841198.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could hear voices inside, but no one came to the door.","translation":"او می توانست صداهایی را از داخل بشنود، اما هیچ کس به در نمی آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841199.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mail was piled up just inside the doorway.","translation":"نامه ها درست در داخل در انباشته شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415021.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sound was coming from inside the house.","translation":"صدا از داخل خانه می آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718823.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were 20 people packed inside of her dorm room.","translation":"20 نفر داخل اتاق خوابگاه او جمع شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841203.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c229a31f-13f9-5f0a-86a6-5b13ca1e25a6','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',3,'country/area','کشور/منطقه','spoken & written','in a country or area – used when you want to emphasize that something is happening there and not in other places',null,null,'در یک کشور یا منطقه - زمانی استفاده می شود که می خواهید تأکید کنید چیزی در آنجا اتفاق می افتد نه در مکان های دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Very little is known of events inside this mysterious country.","translation":"اطلاعات بسیار کمی از وقایع داخل این کشور مرموز وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415026.mp3"},{"sentence":"The guerrillas were said to be operating from bases inside the war zone.","translation":"گفته می شد که چریک ها از پایگاه های داخل منطقه جنگی عملیات می کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415027.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f54969cb-ba6c-534b-9ef0-c315f0e94ade','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',4,'organization','سازمان','spoken & written','if someone is inside a group or organization , they are part of it',null,null,'اگر شخصی در یک گروه یا سازمان باشد، بخشی از آن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"women’s influence inside the party","translation":"نفوذ زنان در حزب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415033.mp3"},{"sentence":"The information comes from sources inside the company.","translation":"اطلاعات از منابع داخل شرکت می آید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415034.mp3"},{"sentence":"Discussions should involve local people both inside and outside the school.","translation":"بحث ها باید شامل افراد محلی در داخل و خارج از مدرسه باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718825.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('af8396ed-d02c-54c4-89ff-3a335e181847','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',5,'head/mind','سر/ذهن','spoken & written','if something happens inside you, or inside your head or mind , it is part of what you think and feel, especially when you do not express it',null,null,'اگر چیزی در درون شما، یا درون ذهن یا ذهن شما اتفاق می افتد، بخشی از آنچه فکر می کنید و احساس می کنید است، به خصوص زمانی که آن را بیان نمی کنید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You just don’t understand how I feel inside!","translation":"تو فقط نمی فهمی من چه احساسی دارم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841205.mp3"},{"sentence":"Steve’s a strange guy – you never know what’s going on inside his head.","translation":"استیو مرد عجیبی است - شما هرگز نمی دانید در سر او چه می گذرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415045.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anger bubbled up deep inside her.","translation":"خشم در اعماق وجودش موج زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415039.mp3"},{"sentence":"Something inside of me told me not to trust him.","translation":"چیزی در درونم به من گفت که به او اعتماد نکن.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841209.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('a3470149-8a2b-5322-a284-dfdfd9c1287c','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',6,'body','بدن','spoken & written','in your body',null,null,'در بدن شما','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She could feel the baby kicking inside her.","translation":"لگد زدن بچه را در درونش احساس می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415050.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ll feel better once you’ve got a good meal inside you (= after you have eaten something ) .","translation":"هنگامی که یک وعده غذایی خوب در درون خود دارید (= بعد از اینکه چیزی خوردید) احساس بهتری خواهید داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415051.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a16cac42-af0f-5011-b6de-a1eb7bc84d15','48b96f98-dcae-5f9f-bcf3-7c29e9d98d59',7,'time','زمان','spoken & written','in less than a particular amount of time',null,null,'در کمتر از یک زمان خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A full report is expected inside three months.","translation":"انتظار می رود گزارش کامل ظرف سه ماه آینده ارائه شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841211.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll be back inside the hour.","translation":"ما ظرف یک ساعت برمی گردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841215.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our aim is to get the whole job finished inside of a week.","translation":"هدف ما این است که کل کار را ظرف یک هفته به پایان برسانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841219.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jonson’s time of 9.3 seconds was just inside the world record.","translation":"زمان 9.3 ثانیه جانسون در رکورد جهانی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415059.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
