('e09abac7-2cf2-53fe-88f6-0250cda4958b','4011f142-bc7c-5d74-b1f2-73a7f7538229',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the British Labour Party',null,null,'حزب کارگر بریتانیا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Most people will pay higher taxes under Labour.","translation":"اکثر مردم مالیات بیشتری را تحت عنوان کارگر پرداخت خواهند کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735499.mp3"},{"sentence":"They always vote Labour .","translation":"آنها همیشه به حزب کارگر رای می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001448258.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c9ca80be-6659-58a8-aff6-8c485ca1c371','74941191-ec99-58a6-b8a3-5fc950041a35',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of equipment used for climbing up to or down from high places. A ladder has two bars that are connected by rung s (= short bars that you use as steps )',null,'Snakes and Ladders , rope ladder , stepladder','نردبان؛ پله (شکست)؛ رده‌بندی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['climb (up/down) a ladder He climbed the ladder up to the diving platform.','go up/down a ladder Be careful going down the ladder!','come up/down a ladder Dickson came up the ladder from the engine room.','descend a ladder formal (= climb down ) He closed the hatch and descended the ladder.','fall off a ladder One of the builders fell off a ladder and broke his leg.','a rung of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The first rung of the ladder was broken.','a step of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The can of paint was balanced on one of the steps of the ladder.','the foot of a ladder (= the bottom of a ladder ) Zach waited at the foot of the ladder while Sam climbed up.','the bottom/top of a ladder She sighed with relief when she reached the bottom of the ladder.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She climbed up the ladder .","translation":"از نردبان بالا رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754084.mp3"},{"sentence":"He hurt himself falling off a ladder .","translation":"با افتادن از نردبان به خودش آسیب زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754090.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('be3914f4-dd9d-5915-92d4-75366983377d','74941191-ec99-58a6-b8a3-5fc950041a35',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a series of levels which someone moves up and down within an organization , profession , or society',null,null,'مجموعه‌ای از سطوحی که شخصی در یک سازمان، حرفه یا جامعه بالا و پایین می‌رود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['climb (up/down) a ladder He climbed the ladder up to the diving platform.','go up/down a ladder Be careful going down the ladder!','come up/down a ladder Dickson came up the ladder from the engine room.','descend a ladder formal (= climb down ) He closed the hatch and descended the ladder.','fall off a ladder One of the builders fell off a ladder and broke his leg.','a rung of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The first rung of the ladder was broken.','a step of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The can of paint was balanced on one of the steps of the ladder.','the foot of a ladder (= the bottom of a ladder ) Zach waited at the foot of the ladder while Sam climbed up.','the bottom/top of a ladder She sighed with relief when she reached the bottom of the ladder.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Stevens slowly worked his way up the corporate ladder.","translation":"استیونز به آرامی از نردبان شرکت بالا رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754099.mp3"},{"sentence":"Becoming a doctor would be a step up the social ladder .","translation":"پزشک شدن یک پله از نردبان اجتماعی خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001449266.mp3"},{"sentence":"the first step on the ladder of success","translation":"اولین پله از نردبان موفقیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754103.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c5c7c9b2-b1e3-5a8e-af0e-a27a7f6d8b05','74941191-ec99-58a6-b8a3-5fc950041a35',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a long thin hole in stocking s or tights where some stitches have broken',null,null,'یک سوراخ نازک طولانی در جوراب ساق بلند یا جوراب شلواری که در آن برخی از بخیه ها شکسته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['climb (up/down) a ladder He climbed the ladder up to the diving platform.','go up/down a ladder Be careful going down the ladder!','come up/down a ladder Dickson came up the ladder from the engine room.','descend a ladder formal (= climb down ) He closed the hatch and descended the ladder.','fall off a ladder One of the builders fell off a ladder and broke his leg.','a rung of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The first rung of the ladder was broken.','a step of a ladder (= the part you put your foot on ) The can of paint was balanced on one of the steps of the ladder.','the foot of a ladder (= the bottom of a ladder ) Zach waited at the foot of the ladder while Sam climbed up.','the bottom/top of a ladder She sighed with relief when she reached the bottom of the ladder.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Yes, I know I’ve got a ladder in my tights.","translation":"بله، می دانم که یک نردبان در جوراب شلواری ام دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754107.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c86dc88e-9fac-5e68-8e35-fe7278902032','62c77fb1-0185-513f-a0a4-05825dddf12d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if stocking s or tights ladder, or if you ladder them, a long thin hole is made in them because some stitches have broken',null,null,'اگر جوراب ساق بلند یا جوراب شلواری نردبان است، یا اگر آنها را نردبان می‌کنید، یک سوراخ نازک دراز در آنها ایجاد می‌شود، زیرا برخی از بخیه‌ها شکسته شده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
