('35119de9-a20a-5192-92aa-da4b3a49672e','6a4a397f-5f84-5804-8069-f28ffc6c939e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is likely will probably happen or is probably true',null,null,'محتمل، به‌احتمال زیاد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/highly/extremely likely It did not seem very likely that he was still alive.','more/most likely At this age, boys were more likely than girls to be active in sports.','quite likely British English (= very likely ) As parents, if we expect bad behaviour we are quite likely to get it.','less/least likely The smallest puppies are the least likely to survive.','hardly likely (= not very likely ) It seems hardly likely that she would tell her husband about it.','more than likely (= very likely ) She''ll be late, more than likely.','increasingly likely The project looked increasingly likely to fail.','seem/appear/look likely Which candidate seems likely to win?','a likely explanation What is the most likely explanation for the way she acted?','a likely result/outcome the most likely outcome of the election','a likely effect/consequence Consider the options open to you, and their likely consequences.','the likely impact (= the likely effect or influence of something ) What is the likely impact of the new factory on the local environment?','a likely cause/reason the likely cause of the accident']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Snow showers are likely tomorrow.","translation":"فردا احتمال بارش برف وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001464530.mp3"},{"sentence":"What are the likely effects of the law going to be?","translation":"تأثیرات احتمالی قانون چه خواهد بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741753.mp3"},{"sentence":"the most likely cause of the problem","translation":"محتمل ترین علت مشکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001828773.mp3"},{"sentence":"Children who live in the country’s rural areas are very likely to be poor.","translation":"کودکانی که در مناطق روستایی کشور زندگی می کنند به احتمال زیاد فقیر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741756.mp3"},{"sentence":"Young drivers are far more likely to have accidents than older drivers.","translation":"احتمال تصادف رانندگان جوان بسیار بیشتر از رانندگان مسن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741762.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is more than likely (= almost certain ) the votes will have to be counted again.","translation":"به احتمال زیاد (= تقریباً قطعی) آرا باید دوباره شمارش شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741763.mp3"},{"sentence":"It could have been an accident, but that was hardly likely (= not very likely ) .","translation":"ممکن بود تصادف باشد، اما به سختی محتمل بود (= نه خیلی محتمل).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741768.mp3"},{"sentence":"He could offer no likely explanation when I asked him.","translation":"وقتی از او پرسیدم هیچ توضیح محتملی نمی تواند ارائه دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741773.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
