('f22c8529-0cfb-5d61-9e39-44f4f4818dfe','d5bdb129-d6a4-5b52-a817-750ed32812cb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the empty space at the side of a page',null,null,'حاشیه (صفحه)؛ حاشیه (سود)؛ ارفاق (مالی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['wide The margin should be wider.','narrow (= not wide ) The margins are very narrow, making the page look cluttered.','a generous margin (= wide ) Leave a generous margin at the side of the page.','the right-hand margin (= on the right of the page ) There were some notes written in the right-hand margin.','the left-hand margin (= on the left of the page ) All typing begins at the left-hand margin.','leave a margin The teacher told us to leave a margin wide enough for him to write corrections.','set the margins (= make them a particular size ) Set the margins to have one inch on each side.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Someone had scribbled a note in the margin .","translation":"یک نفر یادداشتی در حاشیه نوشته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752108.mp3"},{"sentence":"Use double spacing and wide margins to leave room for comments.","translation":"از فاصله دو برابر و حاشیه های وسیع استفاده کنید تا جایی برای نظرات باقی بمانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752109.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3f6aee86-32a4-5d11-9f92-bda7fff2c1b1','d5bdb129-d6a4-5b52-a817-750ed32812cb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the difference in the number of votes , points etc that exists between the winners and the losers of a competition or election',null,null,'تفاوت در تعداد آرا، امتیاز و غیره که بین برنده و بازنده یک مسابقه یا انتخابات وجود دارد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They’re a world-class team and it was no surprise that they won by such a wide margin.","translation":"آنها یک تیم در سطح جهانی هستند و تعجبی نداشت که با اختلاف زیادی پیروز شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000184882.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bill was approved by a margin of 55 votes.","translation":"این لایحه با اختلاف 55 رای به تصویب رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752112.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('59bfc2e5-0447-5c54-8e50-9f85013cb978','d5bdb129-d6a4-5b52-a817-750ed32812cb',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the difference between what it costs a business to buy or produce something and what they sell it for',null,null,'تفاوت بین هزینه ای که برای یک کسب و کار برای خرید یا تولید چیزی صرف می شود و آنچه که آنها آن را می فروشند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Margins are low and many companies are struggling.","translation":"حاشیه سود کم است و بسیاری از شرکت ها با مشکل مواجه هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554006.mp3"},{"sentence":"Within 10 years they had a gross profit margin of 50%.","translation":"در طی 10 سال آنها حاشیه سود ناخالص 50٪ داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554007.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('55f2c110-479e-552a-bbd5-c30ed5fea717','d5bdb129-d6a4-5b52-a817-750ed32812cb',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an additional amount of something such as time, money, or space that you include in order to make sure that you are successful in achieving something','[ usually singular ]',null,'مقدار اضافی چیزی مانند زمان، پول یا مکان که برای اطمینان از موفقیت شما در دستیابی به چیزی در نظر می گیرید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’ll take about 30 minutes to dry but I’d allow a safety margin of, say, another 10 minutes.","translation":"حدود 30 دقیقه طول می کشد تا خشک شود، اما من یک حاشیه ایمنی، مثلاً 10 دقیقه دیگر را می گذارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554018.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
