('facc8a49-b3ff-55e2-bb05-6a2226665632','2df2d98a-0a8d-5baa-88b0-2e04679d9c16',7,'body waste','مواد زائد بدن','spoken & written','solid waste material that comes out when you empty your bowel s – used especially by doctors and nurses','[ countable ]',null,'مواد زائد جامد که هنگام تخلیه روده بیرون می آیند - مخصوصاً توسط پزشکان و پرستاران استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('54c757ef-6195-5f39-9eca-250ec7d92a8d','15428c81-8845-5443-8848-88c59a253af3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give someone directions or instructions by moving your hand or head',null,null,'با حرکت دادن دست یا سر به کسی دستور یا دستورالعمل بدهید',array['signal']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police officer motioned for me to pull over.","translation":"افسر پلیس به من اشاره کرد که خود را کنار بکشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000211480.mp3"},{"sentence":"He motioned to the barman to refill their glasses.","translation":"او به باردار اشاره کرد که لیوان هایشان را دوباره پر کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555070.mp3"},{"sentence":"His father motioned him forward.","translation":"پدرش او را به جلو نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555073.mp3"},{"sentence":"I saw her motioning me into the room.","translation":"او را دیدم که به من اشاره کرد و وارد اتاق شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555076.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('378eb23e-8cb4-5753-b2eb-284c332d43e1','69899614-ae4a-5233-bd36-a54db83931d7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the crime of deliberately killing someone','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'قتل عمد، جنایت قتل؛ قتل (تأکید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['commit (a) murder (= murder someone ) Whoever had committed these murders had planned them carefully.','be guilty of murder They had wished him dead, but that did not make them guilty of murder.','accuse somebody of murder (= say that you think someone murdered a person ) Dillon was accused of both murders.','deny murder (= say that you did not kill someone ) The four accused men all deny murder.','charge somebody with murder (= officially say that someone may be guilty of murder ) Is there enough evidence to charge him with murder?','investigate a murder The police are investigating the murder of a homeless man.','solve a murder (= find out who murdered someone ) The murder has never been solved.','a brutal/horrific murder (= violent and cruel ) He is wanted for the brutal murder of a young girl.','cold-blooded murder (= not caused by strong emotions ) He didn’t kill his wife in a moment of anger; it was cold-blooded murder.','premeditated murder (= planned before it happens ) He was charged with premeditated murder.','an unsolved murder (= for which the killer has never been found ) Police questioned the man about two unsolved murders.','attempted murder (= the crime of trying to kill someone ) I am arresting you for attempted murder.','first-degree murder ( also murder in the first degree ) American English (= the most serious type of murder under U.S. law ) If convicted of first-degree murder, he will spend the rest of his life in prison.','mass murder (= of a large number of people ) Hitler was responsible for the largest mass murder in history.','a murder victim (= someone who has been murdered ) The family of the murder victim pleaded for information to find the killer.','a murder weapon (= the gun, knife etc used to murder someone ) Have they found the murder weapon?','a murder scene (= where a murder happened ) His blood matched the blood found at the murder scene.','a murder investigation A murder investigation is underway after a woman’s body was found in a tunnel.','a murder charge (= an official statement saying someone may be guilty of murder ) He has escaped a murder charge, but his career is finished.','a motive for murder (= a reason to kill someone ) Police believe the motive for the murders was robbery.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"On the night the murder was committed , he was out of the country.","translation":"شبی که قتل انجام شد، او خارج از کشور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974576.mp3"},{"sentence":"The man accused of her murder will appear in court today.","translation":"مرد متهم به قتل او امروز در دادگاه حاضر می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974580.mp3"},{"sentence":"the brutal murder of a child","translation":"قتل وحشیانه یک کودک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000196740.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was found guilty of attempted murder .","translation":"او به اتهام اقدام به قتل مجرم شناخته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974589.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was charged with two counts of first degree murder .","translation":"او به دو فقره قتل درجه یک متهم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974593.mp3"},{"sentence":"The mother of the murder victim wept in court.","translation":"مادر مقتول در دادگاه گریه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974597.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police are searching for the murder weapon .","translation":"پلیس در جستجوی سلاح قتل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974601.mp3"},{"sentence":"Detectives have launched a murder investigation .","translation":"کارآگاهان تحقیقات درباره قتل را آغاز کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974605.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
