('85daf823-0bc7-55a7-b998-12676ed32ef9','2ce3c3b2-a318-5feb-963d-a3ccf48c20f5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a British television comedy that was first broadcast in 2001 and has won Golden Globe and BAFTA award s . The programme is about the lives of workers in the Slough office of a fictional (= not real ) paper company called Wernham Hogg, and is filmed in the style of a documentary . The Office was written and directed by Ricky Gervais and Stephen Merchant . Ricky Gervais plays the part of David Brent, the general manager , who thinks he is much more talented and entertaining than he really is. Other actors appearing in the programme include Martin Freeman , Mackenzie Crook , and Lucy Davis. Local version s of The Office have been in other countries including the US.',null,null,'یک کمدی تلویزیونی بریتانیایی که اولین بار در سال 2001 پخش شد و برنده جایزه گلدن گلوب و بفتا شده است. این برنامه درباره زندگی کارگران دفتر اسلاف یک شرکت کاغذسازی تخیلی (= نه واقعی) به نام ورنهام هاگ است و به سبک مستند فیلمبرداری شده است. The Office توسط Ricky Gervais و Stephen Merchant نوشته و کارگردانی شده است. ریکی جرویس نقش دیوید برنت، مدیر کل را بازی می کند که فکر می کند بسیار با استعدادتر و سرگرم کننده تر از آنچه هست است. از دیگر بازیگران این برنامه می توان به مارتین فریمن، مکنزی کروک و لوسی دیویس اشاره کرد. نسخه های محلی The Office در کشورهای دیگر از جمله ایالات متحده بوده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('1baabbdc-e46c-56be-81d6-61e6ec19b0de','f95eed49-b3f6-5414-a149-77abe7f6d1b1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to disagree with something such as a plan or idea and try to prevent it from happening or succeeding',null,null,'مخالفت کردن، سرکشی کردن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Congress is continuing to oppose the president’s health care budget.","translation":"کنگره همچنان به مخالفت با بودجه مراقبت های بهداشتی رئیس جمهور ادامه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267264.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c2fdd7b5-cf54-530a-a108-2068d553a6a3','f95eed49-b3f6-5414-a149-77abe7f6d1b1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to fight or compete against another person or group in a battle , competition , or election',null,null,'برای مبارزه یا رقابت با شخص یا گروه دیگری در یک نبرد، رقابت یا انتخابات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is opposed by two other candidates.","translation":"او با دو نامزد دیگر مخالف است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267271.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0fa5a4a7-5d1c-57bf-bc4e-396e4ee0cce3','af5a3b52-05a5-53fe-8b58-c0c30ed60cf9',1,'choice','انتخاب','spoken & written','a choice you can make in a particular situation','[ countable ]',null,'گزینه، اختیار؛ اختیار (نرم‌افزار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an option At the moment, children have the option of leaving school at 16. In a situation like this, you have two options.','give/offer somebody an option Some employees were given the option of retiring early. Buyers will usually be offered the option of paying in instalments.','choose an option Fewer women are choosing the option of motherhood.','go for an option (= choose an option ) Which option do you think they''ll go for?','take (up) an option (= choose an option ) America was persuaded not to take up the option of military action.','look at an option (= consider an option ) You have to look at every option as your business develops.','limit your options (= limit what you can choose to do ) If you don’t go to college, it may limit your options.','a good/better option Renting a house may be a better option than buying.','an attractive option (= one that sounds or is good ) If time is short, taking the car to northern France is an attractive option.','a realistic/real/serious option (= something that you can really choose to do ) I wanted to start my own business but financially it was never a realistic option.','a viable/practical option (= something you can choose that will be successful ) Surgery may be a viable option when all else fails.','a popular option Independent sixth-form colleges are becoming a popular option.','a cheap option We urgently need to find a cheaper option than oil or gas.','a safe option (= one that involves no risk ) A special savings account can be a safe option.','somebody’s preferred option formal (= the option someone likes best ) The new scheme appears to be the airport management’s preferred option.','an easy option ( also a soft option British English ) (= a choice which is not difficult, or which needs the least effort ) For most people, divorce is never an easy option.','an option is open/available to somebody (= a particular choice is available to someone ) Giving a prison sentence is only one of the options open to the judge.','keep/leave your options open (= to not limit what you can choose to do later ) Studying a broad range of subjects helps to keep your options open.','have no/little option but to do something (= have no other choice than to do something ) I had no option but to fire him.','a range of options The council is considering a range of options for improving the city’s transport system.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are a number of options available.","translation":"تعدادی گزینه در دسترس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763841.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had two options .","translation":"او دو گزینه داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267796.mp3"},{"sentence":"This was not the only option open to him.","translation":"این تنها گزینه پیش روی او نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763843.mp3"},{"sentence":"a range of options for cutting costs","translation":"طیف وسیعی از گزینه ها برای کاهش هزینه ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578420.mp3"},{"sentence":"Another option is to rent somewhere for six months.","translation":"گزینه دیگر این است که جایی را به مدت شش ماه اجاره کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578423.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had the option of staying for an extra year.","translation":"او این گزینه را داشت که یک سال بیشتر بماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578426.mp3"},{"sentence":"Teenage mothers often have no option but to (= have no other choice except to ) live with their parents.","translation":"مادران نوجوان اغلب چاره ای ندارند جز اینکه (= چاره ای جز این ندارند) با والدین خود زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267804.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
