('193057ae-62bf-5daa-9135-64ff4ed9f595','f818906c-71cb-55cc-906b-323d196175fc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a liquid obtained from petroleum that is used to supply power to the engine of cars and other vehicles',null,null,'بنزین، گازوئیل (بریتانیایی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a litre of petrol','a tankful/tank of petrol (= the amount of petrol that you need to fill up a car ) He bought a tankful of petrol.','a petrol station (= a place where you take your car to fill it with petrol ) We''d better stop at the next petrol station.','a petrol pump (= a machine for putting petrol into cars at a petrol station )','the petrol tank (= the part of a car where you put the petrol ) The petrol tank was nearly empty.','a petrol tanker (= a vehicle used for carrying petrol )','fill (a vehicle) up with petrol She stopped to fill up with petrol.','run out of petrol They ran out of petrol some miles from their destination.','run on petrol Many older vehicles have been converted to run on unleaded petrol.','use petrol Try to cut your motoring costs and use less petrol.','unleaded petrol (= petrol that does not contain lead )','leaded petrol (= petrol that contains lead )']::text[],'[{"sentence":"unleaded petrol","translation":"بنزین بدون سرب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766679.mp3"},{"sentence":"petrol prices","translation":"قیمت بنزین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766680.mp3"},{"sentence":"The petrol tank is leaking.","translation":"مخزن بنزین نشتی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766681.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c0e3e93e-f20c-5621-ba95-5eadb8083561','559cd580-686d-504f-ba72-efbb2f97b585',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of words that have a particular meaning when used together, or which someone uses on a particular occasion',null,null,'عبارت، ترکیب؛ جمله (کوتاه)؛ اصطلاح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a famous/well-known phrase We all hear the phrase "greenhouse gasses", but do you know what it really means?','a memorable phrase Who was it who used that memorable phrase "a monumental error of judgement"?','a colourful phrase (= interesting or rude ) His conversation is full of colourful phrases.','a well-turned phrase (= skilfully invented or chosen ) She creates lifelike characters with a few well-turned phrases.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Who first used the phrase ‘survival of the fittest’?","translation":"چه کسی برای اولین بار از عبارت \"بقای شایسته\" استفاده کرد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001198.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shakespeare’s plays are full of well-known phrases .","translation":"نمایشنامه های شکسپیر پر از عبارات شناخته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001199.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
